* Xác lập kiến trúc tổng thể backend (REST API, phân tầng controller → service → repository → database, tách module theo entity: User, Category, Product, Order, Review)

* Thiết kế schema database đúng Shared Contract : PostgreSQL/prisma

  * Bảng: users, categories, products, product_images, orders, order_items, reviews
  * Ràng buộc: khóa ngoại (product.category_id, order.user_id, review.product_id, review.user_id, order_items.product_id)
  * Index: product(category_id, sold_count, avg_rating), order(user_id, status), review(product_id)

* Implement authentication & authorization:

  * Đăng ký, đăng nhập (JWT/session)
  * Phân quyền role (user | admin)
  * Middleware kiểm tra status (active | locked)

* User service:

  * CRUD user (admin)
  * Lock/unlock user
  * Update profile (name, phone, address)

* Category service:

  * CRUD category
  * Validate uniqueness name

* Product service:

  * CRUD product
  * Upload & quản lý images[] (mapping product_images)
  * Query list:

    * Search theo name
    * Filter category_id
    * Sort (price, sold_count, avg_rating)
  * Aggregate:

    * sold_count (từ order_items)
    * avg_rating, review_count (từ reviews)

* Product detail service:

  * Lấy images[]
  * Lấy reviews theo product_id (pagination)
  * Trả về đầy đủ: sold_count, avg_rating, review_count

* Cart logic (stateless hoặc session-based):

  * Add/remove/update item
  * Validate product tồn tại, giá hiện tại
  * Tính total_price phía server

* Order service:

  * Tạo order:

    * Nhận items[]
    * Snapshot: name, price, image vào order_items
    * Tính total_price
    * status = pending
  * Validate payment_method (COD | BANK_TRANSFER)
  * Lưu name, phone, address

* Order state machine:

  * Enforce flow:

    * pending → confirmed → shipping → completed
    * hoặc cancelled
  * Reject transition sai
  * API update status (admin)

* Order side effects:

  * Khi completed:

    * Tăng product.sold_count
  * Đảm bảo idempotency (tránh double update)

* Order query:

  * User:

    * List theo user_id
    * Detail gồm items[]
  * Admin:

    * List toàn bộ
    * Filter status
    * Pagination

* Review service:

  * Tạo review:

    * Chỉ cho phép nếu user đã có order completed với product_id
  * CRUD (admin delete)
  * Update aggregate:

    * avg_rating
    * review_count

* Validation layer:

  * Input schema (name, phone, address, rating 1–5…)
  * Business rule (quantity > 0, product tồn tại…)

* Error handling:

  * Chuẩn hóa response (code, message)
  * Phân loại: validation / business / system

* API design:

  * Endpoint theo resource:

    * /auth/*
    * /users
    * /categories
    * /products
    * /orders
    * /reviews
  * Pagination, filter, sort consistent

* File/image service:

  * Tích hợp upload (ImageKit) #Tham khảo tại Imagekit Docs
  * Lưu image_url vào product_images
  * Support multiple images[]

* Caching:

  * Cache product list, category list
  * Invalidate khi CRUD

* Concurrency & consistency:

  * Transaction khi tạo order + order_items
  * Lock logic khi update status

* Logging & monitoring:

  * Request log
  * Error log
  * Audit log cho admin actions

* Security:

  * Sanitize input
  * Rate limit auth
  * Protect admin routes


* Testing:

  * Unit test service layer
  * Integration test API (order flow, review rule)

* Deployment:

  * Env config (DB, JWT secret)
  * Migration script
  * Seed data (categories, sample products)

* Documentation:

  * API spec (OpenAPI/Swagger)
  * Mô tả rõ field đúng contract (không đổi tên, không thêm status)
